# Scanner suppressions (SRS-SEC-006).
#
# Every line here must carry an id from security/risk-acceptances.yaml, in the
# form:
#
#   CVE-2025-00000  # RA-0001
#
# tools/security checks that pairing in both directions: a suppression with no
# live acceptance fails the build, and so does an acceptance past its expiry.
# An empty file is the correct steady state.
